# ファイル変換 and an FTP server (design 11.9), for tools/ui_run.py --net user,
# on a test disk as the build made it (a KTEST run keeps a connection on it),
# with a server on this machine's 127.0.0.1:2131 (10.0.2.2 inside): connected
# through the panel, the files listed; two of them (one of 8 MB) carried into
# the BTRON window, which is a 仮身一覧's process: the panel asks how, Enter
# downloads them and makes them 実身 there. The connection kept is then taken
# off with 〈取り外し〉: its window closed, gone from the list and from the
# person's settings ("xfconv: dropped ftp"), and not back when ファイル変換 is
# started again. The machine is turned off at the end, so that the disk kept
# with --keep-disk shows the settings as they were written.
dclick 80 131
wait 1500
open 01a0d8c4-52b1-7c21-9a31-4f5e6d7c8b91
expect xfconv: ready
# a test disk as the build made it: no connection kept yet (rows below are counted from that)
expect xfconv: connections 0
wait 500
win ファイル変換
dclick 182 335
expect xfconv: asked for an FTP connection
wait 500
text 10.0.2.2
key 2b
key 2a
key 2a
text 2131
key 28
expectin 60 xfconv: connected 10.0.2.2
expectin 60 xfconv: dir ftp://10.0.2.2
expect xfconv: - KTEST.TXT 24
expect xfconv: - BIG.BIN 8388608
expect xfconv: connections 1
wait 800
shot xff_list
# BIG.BIN and KTEST.TXT chosen and carried into the BTRON window
click 262 248
key 51 2
expect xfconv: selected 2:
wait 600
hold 262 248
wait 300
move 150 220
wait 100
move 70 195
wait 300
up
expect xfconv: carried 2 into
expect xfconv: asked how to import 2:
wait 500
key 28
expectin 180 xfconv: imported 2 of 2 objects 2
expect xfconv: placed 2 links
wait 800
shot xff_placed
# the connection made just now (the row under ネットワーク(FTP)) chosen; the
# menu opened on it has 〈マウント〉 and 〈取り外し〉 to choose (the shot), and is put away
win ファイル変換
click 155 367
wait 300
down 1
wait 300
up 1
wait 600
shot xff_menu
key 29
wait 300
# 〈取り外し〉 (Ctrl+D): the window of the connection closed, the connection gone
# from the list and from the settings
logmark
key 07 1
expect xfconv: disconnected ftp://10.0.2.2
expectsince xfconv: dropped ftp
expectsince xfconv: connections 0
wait 500
shot xff_dropped
# ファイル変換 ended and started again: the list read back from the settings
key 08 1
wait 2000
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-52b1-7c21-9a31-4f5e6d7c8b91
expectsince xfconv: ready
expectsince xfconv: connections 0
wait 500
shot xff_reopened
absent !OACV!
# the machine turned off as the desktop does it, so that the disk kept (--keep-disk) holds what was written
reboot
